The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository (everything outside
`data/`).

The tournament data on the `data-<Region>` branches is downloaded from the
start.gg API and is not ours to relicense. It is redistributed here so the
rankings built from it can be reproduced; use it subject to start.gg's own
terms of service, and treat this repository as a mirror rather than the source
of truth. `users.jsonl` carries what players chose to make public on their
start.gg profile (tag, country, city, pronoun, linked accounts) and nothing
else; to have your records removed, open an issue and they will be deleted from
the branch head.
